# Verbara cosign public key (ECDSA P-256). Used by .github/workflows/release.yml verify-after-sign step.
# Private key in GitHub secret COSIGN_PRIVATE_KEY + Cloudflare Worker secret VERBARA_COSIGN_PRIVATE_KEY.
# See Verbara.Sdk.Pro/docs/operations/2026-05-10-cosign-keypair-bootstrap.md for custody.
#
# Mirror of .github/cosign.pub kept under docker/ because the customer-facing
# SMB manuales reference `cosign verify --key docker/cosign.pub` (a relative
# path that resolves from any subdirectory under the repo root). Authoritative
# source is .github/cosign.pub + https://verbara.io/keys/cosign.pub — both
# must remain byte-identical (CI digest-reconciliation enforces parity).
